------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope note
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The license above covers the original work in this repository.

It does NOT purport to license third-party material.  In particular, the
baseline code under rasbs/ (notably rasbs_port.py) is described in its own
header as a port of the R-ASBS reference implementation:

  github.com/mattiamosso/Hard-Constrained-Sampling-on-Embedded-Riemannian-
  Manifold-via-Adjoint-Schrodinger-Bridges

That upstream repository carries no license file at the frozen commit we read
(bb71d1496468658f4ff1c9995773968fd12706a8).  We make no claim of ownership over
it, and anyone wishing to reuse rasbs/ should seek permission from its authors.
The upstream clone itself is not redistributed here; .gitignore excludes
rasbs_ref/.
